      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "a good beginning would be a \"dynamic bone\" safety setting. While yes, we can limit the usage for _all_, I would wish a setting that I can choose per rank if I want to have dynamic bones enabled or not. (I personally would do everyone off except friends for example)",
