  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-01-27T00:22:32.133Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I enjoy going to the various dance and live DJ events in VRChat. During these events, I set my safety settings to max to minimize performance impact, but I find many people suffer from blocked shaders.\nI am aware that I can set this in the custom safety settings, but I have that already fine-tuned for my general use outside of the dance events.\nIt would be a pain to need to set those every time I go into a specific situation, so I thought that it would be beneficial to many if we could get an additional custom safety setting preset or two.\nThese could be set up for specific events situations and can easily be swapped to with little downtime.",
